      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "By the time Cassian understood how much other people knew about him, refusing had begun to feel less like a decision and more like a threat. He didn't tell Ninja. He couldn't bear to watch the knowledge change the way she looked at him. There were nights when his phone displayed a number and he stared until it stopped ringing. There were days when he made promises to himself about finishing one final obligation and disappearing from it all. He told himself that a clean break still existed somewhere.",
      "scene": "The Money He Didn't Explain",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=538ef8dd289249a18695814346d96604.wav",
      "duration": 27.84471655328798
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-132",
      "run_id": 122,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "He only had to reach it. One afternoon, Cassian sat in his parked car outside a supermarket with the engine off. He had just finished a call with somebody connected to Elias Voss. The caller had agreed, in an almost friendly tone, that of course Cassian could stop working for them. After one more errand. Cassian stared at his reflection in the rearview mirror. He looked older than he remembered.",
      "scene": "The Money He Didn't Explain",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=205935a12d3f462b8839de01d3d2db1a.wav",
      "duration": 22.86106575963719
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "line-133",
      "run_id": 122,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "He dialed Ninja's number, waited for her to answer, and listened as she told him—without taking a breath—that her upstairs neighbor had somehow flooded the bathroom by trying to install a shelf. He laughed. It surprised him.",
      "scene": "The Money He Didn't Explain",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=45b2c39d77c64882bbbba15f34504809.wav",
      "duration": 12.860907029478458
    },
