      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "source_text": "He wanted to say yes. Instead he promised to try. When the call ended he sat still for a long time, making a decision he didn't yet know how to carry out: whatever else he had to do, he would find a way to keep those people away from her. The last time Ninja had dinner with Cassian, he turned up carrying a badly wrapped parcel and an apology.",
      "scene": "The Money He Didn't Explain",
      "url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=0b0e2a6436d44f45bf96c5a8b19f2bb5.wav",
